{"id":56017,"ord":117,"n_segments":180,"prev":56016,"next":56018,"doc":{"id":"68098","title":"68098_Snub Mosley oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Snub Mosley","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/68098/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=68098"},"chapter":"Leading his own band in New York","title":"Gino's on 54th Street and Morton Gould","category":"venue_city_scene","summary":"At Gino's he meets Bert Schepter and Morton Gould, who invites the band to the Top of the Theatre.","period":"c. 1939","year_from":1939,"year_to":1939,"words":160,"start":[185,5],"end":[187,0],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=68098#s56017","tags":{"places":[{"name":"54th Street","focus":1,"type":"street","in":"New York"},{"name":"Sixth Avenue","focus":0,"type":"street","in":"New York"},{"name":"Seventh Avenue","focus":0,"type":"street","in":"New York"},{"name":"Philadelphia","focus":0,"type":"city"},{"name":"Hollywood","focus":0,"type":"neighborhood","in":"Los Angeles"}],"venues":[{"name":"Gino's","focus":1,"city":"New York"},{"name":"Billy Rose Theatre","focus":0,"city":"New York"}],"bands":[{"name":"Snub Mosley's band","focus":1,"leader":"Snub Mosley"}]},"people":[{"name":"Morton Gould","qid":"Q1352656","n":3},{"name":"Bert Schepter","qid":null,"n":3},{"name":"David Rose","qid":"Q937852","n":2},{"name":"ARRANGER","qid":null,"n":1},{"name":"Gordon Jenkins","qid":"Q1388198","n":1}],"story":{"theme":36,"theme_name":"Coming to New York: clubs, jams, and making it","community":73,"community_name":"Making it in New York: arrival, clubs and the scene","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":185,"b":5,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"Where did you go after the Barrell of Fun? Did you go to Philadelphia then?"},{"p":185,"b":6,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"I went down to Philadelphia and then we went up to another place called Gino's, on 54th Street."},{"p":185,"b":7,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"54th Street?"},{"p":185,"b":8,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"Right."},{"p":185,"b":9,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"Yeah?"},{"p":186,"b":0,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"That's where I used to meet Schepter."},{"p":186,"b":1,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"Bert Schepter?"},{"p":186,"b":2,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"Bert Schepter."},{"p":186,"b":3,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"They had an exclusive club, a musician's club on top of the Billy Rose Theatre on Sixth Avenue and we were right off Seventh Avenue. This arranger used to come in and catch me every night too."},{"p":186,"b":4,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"What was his name?"},{"p":186,"b":5,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"Had a great big name, symphonic and everthing in it."},{"p":186,"b":6,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"David Rose?"},{"p":186,"b":7,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"No, it wasn't David Rose."},{"p":186,"b":8,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"He went to Hollywood."},{"p":186,"b":9,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"Gordon Jenkins?"},{"p":186,"b":10,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"No. Gould."},{"p":186,"b":11,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"Morton Gould?"},{"p":186,"b":12,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"Morton Gould."},{"p":186,"b":13,"s":"MR. DRIGGS","x":"He's around here now."},{"p":187,"b":0,"s":"MR. MOSLEY","x":"As a matter of fact, Morton Gould was the one that asked me to come up as his guest one night up at the Top of the Theatre and when I went I took the band and played."}]}